OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,6,Fto Wednesday, but some patchy cloud
OL,7,Fsoon developing through the morning.
OL,8,FRemaining dry throughout, but winds
OL,9,Fbecoming light.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FCloudy and mild Thursday, with rain
OL,13,Farriving overnight. Brighter on Friday
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells and perhaps a few
OL,15,Fisolated showers. Mainly dry and
OL,16,Fbright Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
